values ('ap_physics_2', 9, '9.1', array['9.1']::text[], 'diagram', 'Maxwell–Boltzmann distribution (qualitative)', 'A graph of the energies or speeds of atoms at a given temperature; students relate its features to temperature but need not know its functional form.', '[{"label": "Horizontal axis", "meaning": "Atomic speed or energy"}, {"label": "Vertical axis", "meaning": "Relative number of atoms at each speed or energy"}, {"label": "Curve features", "meaning": "Features of the curve are related to the gas temperature"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-2-reference-u9-u11-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_2-u9-r1-005; ced=9.1.B.1.i: "The Maxwell–Boltzmann distribution provides a graphical representation of the energies and speeds of atoms at a given temperature."')
