values ('ap_physics_2', 9, '9.3', array['9.3']::text[], 'convention', 'Direction of spontaneous thermal transfer', 'Energy is transferred through thermal processes spontaneously from the higher-temperature system to the lower-temperature system, because in atomic collisions energy is most likely transferred from higher-energy to lower-energy atoms.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-2-reference-u9-u11-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_2-u9-r1-012; ced=9.3.A.3: "spontaneously from a higher-temperature system to a lower-temperature system"')
