values ('ap_physics_2', 9, '9.4', array['9.4']::text[], 'vocabulary', 'Internal energy', 'The internal energy of a system is the sum of the kinetic energy of the objects that make up the system and the potential energy of the configuration of those objects.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-2-reference-u9-u11-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_2-u9-r1-014; ced=9.4.A.1: "sum of the kinetic energy of the objects that make up the system and the potential energy of the configuration"')
