values ('ap_physics_2', 9, '9.4', array['9.4']::text[], 'formula', 'Work done on a gas at constant pressure', 'W = -P\Delta V', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'The sign matters: W is work done on the gas, so it is positive when the gas is compressed (\Delta V < 0) and negative when it expands. The PV-diagram area gives only the absolute value.', 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-2-reference-u9-u11-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_2-u9-r1-018; ced=9.4.B.1.iii: "work done on a system by a constant or average external pressure that changes the volume"')
